# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# Toolchains / scratch (1.7 GB: rustup, zig.exe) — not project sources
/scratch/

# Build artifacts
/build/
/dist/
/dist_rc/
numfast-native/target/
# Generated packaging metadata. setuptools rewrites this directory on every
# `python -m build` / `pip install .`, including `SOURCES.txt`, whose content
# depends on the machine (.gitignore excludes *.pdb, so a clone that has no
# .pdb on disk produces a SOURCES.txt without it -- tracking the file made
# every documented build command leave the tree dirty). Untracked 2026-10-05;
# nothing reads it.
#
# MANIFEST.in's `prune src/numfast.egg-info` does NOT keep it out of the sdist:
# setuptools.command.sdist.run appends <egg_info>/SOURCES.txt to the file list
# after MANIFEST.in has been applied, so no directive in MANIFEST.in can reach
# it. setup.py's local `sdist` subclass drops it instead.
src/numfast.egg-info/

# Native artifacts
*.nfs
*.pdb

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.DS_Store
# NOTE: the rules above are anchored at the repo root, so `scratch/` here means
# the top-level developer-toolchain directory only. Test golden oracles live in
# tests/oracles/ (tracked).
